etter and some continuity errors are fixed! We should have a new update in a few days for the full game, a new harder game mode that the standard three that uses relationship decay, no longer can you neglect friends and expect them to like you as much! Thank y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T00:27:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672735","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4989370-1844115010491905","game_id":"steam-4989370","kind":"update","title":"Music and Art update!","summary":"Salutations!We have just added music and location art to the game. Each track can be volume adjusted and the old art can be brought back, both from the in-game esc menu!As a result we are keeping the Playtest going through next weekend so people can check it out if they want to!Granitefire Games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T12:43:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010491905","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4989370-1839676055889686","game_id":"steam-4989370","kind":"announcement","title":"Hello World!","summary":"Greetings everyone!This is our first game here on steam! Its a big milestone for a new developer. Our game is mostly complete just missing balancing and polishing!Anyways, we need playtesters! So if this seems like something you would be willing do, click the request access button on the main store page. It might take a few days for everything do get working properly with the playtest. We cant promise everyone will get access but we will try to get a good number of people into the playtest.Our p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T01:00:28Z","time_prec